OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Alorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after he was hit by a
OL,7,Florry in west Belfast.
OL,9,FThe collision, on the Falls Road, was
OL,10,Freported to police shortly after 01:00
OL,11,FBST on Friday.
OL,13,FThe emergency services attended but the
OL,14,Fpedestrian was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FThe road was closed between Grosvenor
OL,18,FRoad and Sevastopol Street for a number
OL,19,Fof hours while the scene was examined,
OL,20,Fbut it later reopened to traffic.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
